\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUewQZi3RVEQ7kNvwH_1x-a&_nc_oc=Adrj5oyDfAkounfcM4z0gl2KqR8awahklI7nrNIn9tazquyKcPTXpiJ07gjJmsDz77o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWHCcKxmeTzCAcvNgJFPUo0942RvmIBnHNsGjayLGTPrg&oe=6B104F76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2VBCJ1T2TW8Q7kNvwHaBy94&_nc_oc=AdpQE1IOldkg4h5QZrnsTQ-NDg3K-q8x-_LrTyitt6JfAASpsHAjwuMDjwdIfv-J5OU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVsJvrLN3k0adJ1BrZ1NHH87q27bvxIHbafMgAFcOywYA&oe=6B104B76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ul_KkgKxxH0Q7kNvwFc_b7M&_nc_oc=Ado5ja9ZFTXIYWtZ7kwczDyWRpE_jW3xcJBSM7TISsxnC9OMva042G1g_Oc2_6mHvsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXTDM-RFZwBhbLMSzl1P-1LezNPnXcqE-04IXgfprGYEg&oe=6B104FFE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u